    "created_at": "2026-06-27T11:39:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-27T11:39:57Z",
    "body": "I'm supportive of introducing a limit. Additionally I wonder if having multiple encodings of the same type: such as `br, br` is something that we should allow?\nLast time I looked at this, I think Safari ignored multiple encodings of the same type.",
